# Regenerable verification scratch: full copies of every block's style.css, made
# by the verification runs (~1.5MB of duplicated CSS). Recreate by copying
# src/blocks/*/style.css into build-copy/ and running run-transform.js against it.
# anti-vacuity-dead-detector.js is NOT ignored — it is the deliberately-broken
# detector the anti-vacuity control needs, and the control cannot be reproduced
# without it.
build-copy/
pre-transform-baseline/
